---
import { PHASES, TITLES, SVG_WIDTH, SVG_HEIGHT } from "../lib/memory-camp";
import { campFallback } from "../lib/memory-camp-fallback";
const faces = campFallback();
---
<aside class="memory-example memory-camp" data-active-phase="conversation" aria-labelledby="example-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Illustrative example · fictional project</p>
  <h2 id="example-title">What you learn comes with you.</h2>
  <div class="camp-art" data-renderer="static" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="camp-fallback" viewBox={`0 0 ${SVG_WIDTH} ${SVG_HEIGHT}`} fill="none">
      <ellipse cx="310" cy="294" rx="192" ry="45" class="camp-shadow" />
      {faces.map(face => <path d={face.path} data-camp-region={face.phase} data-camp-hero={face.hero} data-camp-ring={face.ring} style={`--camp-paint:var(--camp-${face.token});--shade:${face.shade}%;`} />)}
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="camp-hint">Choose the campfire, desk, or gate to explore.</p>
  <fieldset class="memory-stage-controls"><legend class="visually-hidden">Explore how Lore uses memory</legend>
    {PHASES.map((phase,index) => <label><input type="radio" name="memory-stage" value={phase} checked={index === 0} aria-label={`${TITLES[index]} · ${phase === "knowledge" ? "Knowledge" : phase === "recall" ? "Next session" : "Conversation"}`} aria-controls={`memory-stage-${phase}`} /><span><strong>{TITLES[index]}</strong><small>{phase === "knowledge" ? "Knowledge" : phase === "recall" ? "Next session" : "Conversation"}</small></span></label>)}
  </fieldset>
  <div class="memory-stage-panels" aria-live="polite">
    <section id="memory-stage-conversation"><h3>You explain a decision</h3><p>“Keep webhook handlers idempotent. The provider can deliver the same event twice. Also, let’s get lunch at noon.”</p></section>
    <section id="memory-stage-knowledge"><h3>The project rule becomes knowledge</h3><p class="file-label">.lore.md</p><blockquote><strong>Idempotent webhooks:</strong> Reuse the existing event-id check before applying a webhook.</blockquote></section>
    <section id="memory-stage-recall"><h3>A later session has the context</h3><p><strong>Task:</strong> Add retries to the webhook handler.</p><p>“I’ll reuse the event-id check.” The lunch plan is unrelated to this task.</p></section>
  </div>
  <a class="small" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}docs/example/`}>Try this workflow in a sample project →</a>
</aside>
<script>import "../scripts/memory-camp";</script>
